[[0,826758,0,98,10,88,"2016-01-30T10:16:24","monoxane","",[],"","Horrified graduates flee as planes carped bomb them with hats","http://i.imgur.com/4iS22ib.jpg","pics"],[1,4102063,0,7,0,7,"2016-01-30T11:01:27","veo","",[],"<p>how does one carped bomb another? are the planes flown by fish?</p>"],[1,4102531,0,0,0,0,"2016-01-30T12:51:01","ty_dupp","",[],"<p>The screaming of the graduates... truly causes a tear in my eye. I have great empathy for what they must be feeling. <em>shakes fist at sky</em> damn you, hats!</p>"],[1,4103002,0,2,0,2,"2016-01-30T14:32:52","leavethebag","",[],"<p>There were no survivors. </p>\n<p>Coming up at 6. Is your refrigerator running? Well these specialists say its time to upgrade. </p>"],[1,4103232,0,2,0,2,"2016-01-30T15:12:25","Grind_Goddess","",[],"<p>Can we please start a <a href=\"/v/inaccuratecaptions\">/v/inaccuratecaptions</a> or something with content like this?</p>"],[1,4103624,0,0,0,0,"2016-01-30T16:01:25","Gaynelle","",[],"<p>happiest days of your life.</p>"],[1,4161582,0,0,0,0,"2016-02-04T14:12:44","hats_","",[],"<p>Thought it was going to be more like <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dtxPp9UOcIc\">this.</a></p>"]]
[[0,826759,0,4,0,4,"2016-01-29T23:16:52","industrialfish","",[],"<p>I went and saw Muse in Detroit, and Ticketmaster emailed me a voucher for free iTunes download or physical copy of the CD for each of the 3 tickets I bought, which I thought was a nice way to offset their \"service fee\". Well I redeemed it for 3 CDs on their website and received shipping notice a few days later. Then received another shipping conformation a few days later, and repeat.</p>\n<p>All told they sent me 12 packages with 3 retail CDs in each package :)</p>\n<p>It's too much hassle to sell them on eBay one at a time, and I'm not going to take them to the firing range, so what shall I do?</p>","So what should I do with 32 unopened copies of Muse's album \"Drones\"?","","AskVoat"],[1,4101923,0,2,1,1,"2016-01-30T10:35:08","un_salamandre","",[],"<p>Get 32 CD players and make an epic symphony! Extra points for canon.</p>"],[1,4102091,0,5,0,5,"2016-01-30T11:05:11","golisten2lennywhite2","",[],"<p>Make a drone.</p>"],[1,4102149,0,3,0,3,"2016-01-30T11:15:53","HotRod32","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>I'm not going to take them to the firing range</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Yes, but have you ever wondered how many copies of Muse's &quot;Drones&quot; it takes to stop a bullet?</p>"],[2,4102161,4102149,2,0,2,"2016-01-30T11:18:10","riposte","",[],"<p>This could save lives. </p>"],[3,4112002,4102161,0,0,0,"2016-01-31T06:32:26","AnoInc","",[],"<p>Op is obligated now. For science.</p>"],[1,4102608,0,2,0,2,"2016-01-30T13:09:56","CantBuySkills","",[],"<p>Just burn them.</p>"],[2,4103429,4102608,1,0,1,"2016-01-30T15:35:36","GoatSLAVE","",[],"<p>Seriously, one of the most overrated bands of the 21st century</p>"],[1,4103472,0,1,0,1,"2016-01-30T15:40:31","Dantalian","",[],"<p>Dump them into the ocean so that the dolphins can enjoy them. They're clever creatures and big fans of Muse!</p>"],[1,4105641,0,1,0,1,"2016-01-30T19:36:37","Big_Amish","",[],"<p>Donate them to a local charity or library.</p>"]]
